One way would be to use vim as an editor. As the OP is perhaps using the
hjkl keys for moving, the usage won't be so hard to learn ;) Add the
following lines to your .vimrc (whatever that is on Windows):

"enable mouse
set mouse=a
"wrap lines
set textwidth=70 wrap

